  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Steven G. Bradbury said he planned to use AI to accelerate the rulemaking process and achieve quicker turnaround in drafting proposed rules. Bradbury also said the secretary had made clear that the department would develop a clear national framework for regulating autonomous vehicles.",
